S PanelIndex.cpp           | 69 lines   | bdf2ea6b | 4 sym  | Declaration, release and resolution over a fixed panel ledger — no allocation, no ImGui, no vendor spelling.
S WorkspaceBracket.cpp     | 225 lines  | 546fe638 | 4 sym  | The one call an application makes per tick — workspace strip, desk, bottom band, all on the foreground recording.
S WorkspaceDrag.cpp        | 539 lines  | 80439e82 | 15 sym | The one drag in flight — the press that becomes a tear, the window that follows the pointer, and the landing on release.
S WorkspacePanel.cpp       | 694 lines  | 61044e4f | 15 sym | The in-body panel layer — docked bands beneath, floating boxes above, and the three drags each of them carries.
S WorkspaceSpace.cpp       | 1151 lines | 2f46b220 | 30 sym | Minting, withdrawal and layout for the desk — the recursion itself is templated and lives in the header.
S WorkspaceStrip.cpp       | 1039 lines | 8342b61b | 28 sym | The trapezoid strip every leaf and window carries — foreground quads, hand-rolled overlays, and inline rename.
S WorkspaceStripInternal.h | 196 lines  | f4a189c6 | 23 sym | What the desk's own translation units share — the strip, its geometry, and the intent a tick defers.

